{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Pinch","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinch"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Preview","anchor":"Preview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"The patch","anchor":"The-patch","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami drives this with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" — a remembered on\/off state — flipped by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a pinch and fed into a Transform Scale. There’s no helper to reach for: it maps straight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"onto native SwiftUI, which is the reusable idea worth taking away. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MagnifyGesture"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reads the pinch, a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"text":" flag flips at a threshold, and a ","type":"text"},{"code":".spring","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" animates the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scale between the two states (see the State\/memory → ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" row in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@State private var popped = false","","RoundedTriangle(cornerRadius: 20)","    .frame(width: 90, height: 80)","    .scaleEffect(popped ? 2 : 1)","    .animation(.spring(response: 0.35, dampingFraction: 0.7), value: popped)","    .gesture(","        MagnifyGesture().onEnded { value in","            if value.magnification > 1.25 { popped = true }","            else if value.magnification < 0.8 { popped = false }","        }","    )"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The pop is the point: a discrete state the gesture toggles, animated with a spring — not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a scale that tracks your fingers continuously.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"How it’s built","anchor":"How-its-built","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The full view sits the white rounded triangle on the magenta artboard and adds a live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@GestureState"},{"type":"text","text":" so the shape follows your fingers mid-pinch before it settles on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"popped state. Read the source (below) for the whole thing."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Behavior","anchor":"Behavior","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pinch out on the shape to grow it; pinch in to shrink it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cross the threshold and it snaps to the next size with a spring, rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking your fingers continuously.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The switch remembers its state, so a release between pinches holds the current size.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Downloads","anchor":"Downloads","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode sample"}]},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/swamikit.github.io\/swami\/dev\/downloads\/Interaction_Pinch.zip","type":"reference"},{"text":" — the runnable project (same as the button above).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift source"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swamikit\/swami\/blob\/development\/app\/Swami\/Patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" — the single source file to read."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami source","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/origami.design\/public\/origami_files\/patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.origami"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"roleHeading":"Sample Code","role":"sampleCode","title":"Interaction — Pinch"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Patterns","title":"Patterns","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"]}],"sampleCodeDownload":{"action":{"isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Download Xcode sample","type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/swamikit.github.io\/swami\/dev\/downloads\/Interaction_Pinch.zip"},"kind":"sampleDownload"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Pinch a shape to scale it. Past a threshold it pops to an enlarged size with a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spring; pinch back in and it pops home.","type":"text"}],"references":{"https://swamikit.github.io/swami/dev/downloads/Interaction_Pinch.zip":{"identifier":"https:\/\/swamikit.github.io\/swami\/dev\/downloads\/Interaction_Pinch.zip","url":"https:\/\/swamikit.github.io\/swami\/dev\/downloads\/Interaction_Pinch.zip","checksum":null,"type":"download"},"https://github.com/swamikit/swami/blob/development/app/Swami/Patterns/Interaction_Pinch.swift":{"titleIn